I could not identify the fixing commit or PR for O3-5993. The ticket key does not appear in any indexed file in the 42 repositories, and my tools can't search commit messages. The code that now produces the message is clear, though.

**Implementing line:** `openmrs-esm-admin-tools/packages/esm-reports-app/src/components/reports-data-overview.component.tsx` lines 76-87. It collects the labels of required parameters that have no value (lines 76-78) and passes them into the `missingParameters` string, so the error names the missing parameters (lines 80-87). The guard is at line 80, and the snackbar call with the translated subtitle is at lines 81-87.

**Message text:** `openmrs-esm-admin-tools/packages/esm-reports-app/translations/en.json` line 34 holds `"missingParameters": "Please provide the following parameters: {{parameters}}"`. The other locale files carry the same key.

**Regression tests:** `openmrs-esm-admin-tools/packages/esm-reports-app/src/components/reports-data-overview.test.tsx` lines 71-85 test a blank required parameter and expect the subtitle `Please provide the following parameters: Start Date, Location`. Lines 87-99 cover the case where only some parameters are filled. The first test's name, "lists the names of missing required parameters instead of a literal placeholder", matches the reported bug.

Searches that found nothing: `O3-5993` returns no files in any repository, and `5993` in the admin-tools repo only matches yarn.lock checksums.

